      "id": 21,
      "options": {
        "content": "### How to read this dashboard\n\nThis dashboard is for Coditor-observed Codex traffic through the local Envoy and coditor-core path. It is still not production readiness proof.\n\n**Codex requests and tokens** come from `coditor_requests_total` and `coditor_tokens_total` with `provider=\"codex_responses\"`.\n\n**Context fill** is a bounded histogram of context-window fill percentage with provider and normalized Codex model labels.\n\n**Codex diagnosis causes** show bounded `codex_*` degradation causes. Session ids must not appear in metric labels.\n\n**Cached input** is Codex/OpenAI cached input from Responses usage details. It is reported exactly as a Responses usage detail.\n\n**Model fallbacks** mean the requested model was not the one actually served.\n\n**Estimated cost** is best-effort and unpriced Codex models stay explicit zero-cost estimates until a trusted pricing catalog is configured.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.1.0",
      "title": "Terminology Guide",
      "description": "Short definitions for the dashboard's main terms and KPIs.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
